From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:35:02 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): replace the parameter holder with the tool body in
 preview

Remove the unused holder from the editor outline when body bands exist.
Pin body fill, outline and frame behavior and retain the no-body control.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2005
